 "content_notes": "A debate, never a verdict: every doubt is attributed (a researcher, records) and Abagnale's rebuttal is on screen. Frank Abagnale (a living person) appears only as a faceless dark silhouette in a generic pilot's uniform tagged ILLUSTRATION · NOT A LIKENESS; nothing from the 2002 film is shown (no poster, still or actor likeness); the film and the airlines are named as plain text only, with no logo, livery or badge. The researcher, the flight attendants, the teller, the cinema-goers and the young man are generic figures; the researcher is never drawn as a portrait. The prison record card, the memoir and the check are our own generic graphics, not replicas of real documents. The $2.5 million figure is shown as HIS claim. No dialogue is invented. Status verified 2026-10-17.",
